\\ y\\end{aligned}]⟶\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "Consider a general vector $\\,[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}].$ Multiplying by the matrix $T,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3x \\\\ 4x-y\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the linear transformation $\\,T\\,$ is given by\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}3x \\\\ 4x-y\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-317039/field-1" "q-317039/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "656da168-af12-53c2-8add-2c82cf71b31c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317039"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-74925/selection/7c4e84fb72467108da0b8235e537019644d09d1a7218ea89e5f7a483bd928ea5" :answer/id #uuid "faed4662-b351-59cd-a079-a1255dec1b74" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "T:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}-y \\\\ x+3y\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74925/selection/e74c9a3fdc4fa0d11d52b66fecef22b0214166d61af0a2462f7916318dade051" :answer/id #uuid "2e0c568a-3e25-5ab5-a1f8-41e9d60d84e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "T:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}y \\\\ x-3y\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74925/selection/21e507e2e09591c1af508a9c669bb6457c8a8776ed58a17d4a441c7b095dd910" :answer/id #uuid "7584f1ac-56de-5315-8b38-44f7965f4332" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "T:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}-y \\\\ 3x-y\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74925/selection/b9c27456d6557147bdac31a701ba707bffab663345df4e0214989e24f5257dc6" :answer/id #u